			"notes": "Changelog - v0.6.0\n[+]\n- Added catnip sword\n- Added catnip pickaxe\n- Added catnip axe\n- Added catnip hoe\n- Added catnip shovel\n- Added hardened catnip\n- Added catnip shard\n[NEW RECIPES]\nAll the tools are crafted normally like any other tools.\nThe hardened catnip is made by smelting/blasting a catnip block.\nA catnip shard is made by stonecutting hardened catnip.\n\n[+/]\n- New scratching block textures"
		},
