			"notes": "This really doesn't need a changelog so here's a summary:\nIt was really late at night, I had finally finished coding the recipes for all the different blocks and I realized we needed a scratching block to go with it.\n\nI quickly added the block, never ran the datagen and just released and slept.\nNow, thanks to one of my beta testers that had tested the mod, it turned out that the mod was crashing because I was copying the properties of `BAMBOO_BLOCK` which did not have the `axis` property. I changed it to oak planks and the mod works fine. Please, please forgive me that I released an update without proper testing.\n\nEnjoy v0.5.5, the next update will be v0.6.0 :D"
		},
