			"notes": "Changelog (v0.5.3)\n[+]\n- Optimizations to loading models, recipes, loot tables & more\n- New recipes:\n  - Conversion from 9 raw catnip to catnip block and vice versa stays\n  - Smelting catnip ore/deepslate catnip ore still gives raw catnip\n  - Blasting cooked catnip now makes catnip ember\n  - Smelting cooked catnip makes suspicious catnip\n  \n  - Added Catnip Detector recipe:\n    \" B \"\n    \" B \"\n    \"BCB\"\n  This represents the Crafting Table grid.\n  \"B\" means Iron Ingot\n  \"C\" means Catnip Ember\n\n[/]\n - Fixed multiple bugs\n - Fixed texture loading sometimes taking an abnormal amount of time\n```"
